    "heading": "Strong Wind",
    "lineStart": 14102,
    "lineEnd": 14106
  },
  "section": "9.35",
  "rulesText": "Strong wind imposes Disadvantage on ranged attack rolls with weapons. It also extinguishes open flames and disperses fog. A flying creature in a strong wind must land at the end of its turn or fall.\n\nA strong wind in a desert can create a sandstorm that imposes Disadvantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks."
}
